/* Elite Force module ABI numbers, independently recorded interoperability
 * facts: FNTECH3_STVEF_MODULE_CALL(module, direction, name, sp, mp).
 * sp: the retail single-player cgame's vmMain command or syscall number in
 *     efgamex86.dll (its game and menus use function tables, not ordinals);
 * mp: the retail Holomatch QVM ordinal; -1 where a mode has no such call.
 * SP numbers match Raven's SP mod SDK and the retail stvoy.exe dispatcher
 * (0x402b20); Holomatch numbers match the retail stvoyHM.exe dispatchers and
 * Lilium Voyager. See docs/fntech3/2026-09-18-stvef-holomatch.md. */

